WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900
Christians call the Bible the Word of God.

2
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:06.160
They believe it passes on
what God has made known.

3
00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:09.940
Yet human beings wrote it
down, over hundreds of years,

4
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:12.750
first on scrolls and later in books.

5
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.020
So is it God's word, or human words?

6
00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:18.050
How can the Bible be both?

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.840
In this mission, you'll meet three
views of the Bible's authority,

8
00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:25.140
from the literal Word
of God to a human guide.

9
00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:30.610
Then you'll weigh up a claim: is the
Bible the only authority Christians need?

10
00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:36.210
Your mission: find out how the Bible can
be both human words and the Word of God.
